---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import NavBar from "../components/NavBar.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ContentFlow App Pricing"
  description="Current pricing assumptions and commercial direction for ContentFlow App."
>
  <main class="page-shell">
    <NavBar />

    <section class="section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Pricing Hypothesis</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">Commercial model is not finalized in this repository.</h1>
        <p>
          The project currently documents behavior and operational promises before
          locking a final offer. Reliability and continuity are the first packaging
          criteria.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <article class="price-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Current Focus</p>
          <h2>Proof over monetization</h2>
          <p>
            The immediate goal is a coherent operator experience for creators and
            small teams: onboarding, review workflows, scheduling, and degraded-mode
            behavior.
          </p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>single authenticated surface</li>
            <li>clear continuity between sessions</li>
            <li>human review gates before publication</li>
          </ul>
        </article>

        <article class="price-card accent-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">What matters to users first</p>
          <h2>Consistency and trust</h2>
          <p>
            The first buying motion should be clear because the value is operational:
            less drift, better queue behavior, and fewer blind spots.
          </p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>explicit status + retry states</li>
            <li>resilient action model</li>
            <li>fast workflow orientation</li>
          </ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">How to evaluate now</p>
        <h2>Use the docs + workflows as the decision source.</h2>
        <p>
          Until commercial terms are announced, the best evaluation is operational.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/docs">Read the docs</a>
          <a class="button button-secondary" href="/contact">Ask about access</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
